      "writtenOn": "2025-02-20T13:09:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently some of our drivers are using those stuffs for proper working. We are trying to prepare solution under which noone is using it, but currently it seems that some functionalities will stop working without this change included.",
