      "writtenOn": "2025-02-20T15:55:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What specific functionalities?  And I am pretty sure this will break the existing kernel api.  This branch is long frozen for new features, attempting to add this at this late of a date (i.e. years after the feature freeze), is not a good idea.\n\nAlso, as this adds a new user/kernel api, the system is not prepared to mediate that new api, so from a security point of view alone, odds are this is not going to be acceptable for Android13 devices.",
      "parentUuid": "02a2c998_5bf9f223",
      "revId": "39c128f8329185852e56275a7847f6cb273319a5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
