      "writtenOn": "2025-02-23T01:24:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "FWIW, this breaks downstream drivers due to \n\n`gpiod_export_link` and `gpiod_export` becoming exported symbols being `static inline` functions before this change.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android-mainline:common/include/linux/gpio/consumer.h;l\u003d629?q\u003dgpiod_export",
      "revId": "39c128f8329185852e56275a7847f6cb273319a5",
